        <activityName xml:lang="en">Transport, liquefied natural gas TT, freight ship</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Transport, liquefied natural gas TT, freight ship
UUID=20d99fcd-bca7-3678-b7c2-b340b154efc9
This dataset describes the transport of Trinidadian and Tobagan liquefied natural gas on a LNG tanker.
Location: Global data für fuel requirements and emissions.
Technology: LNG tanker with a dual fuel diesel-cycle engine as propulsion technology.
Time period: Data for fuel requirements stems from 2006, for emissions from 2015 and 2019.
Production volume: not known
Sampling: Literature.
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_20d99fcd-bca7-3678-b7c2-b340b154efc9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
